    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n'Maresa', 5 Lower Sallynoggin Road presents an exceptional fusion of comfort, character, and convenience.\nIdeally positioned in the heart of the vibrant and well-established Sallynoggin community, this charming two-bedroom cottage offers a rare opportunity to acquire a home of warmth and distinction in a highly desirable setting. Ready for immediate occupation and rich in character, it is perfectly suited to first-time buyers, those seeking to downsize, or anyone in search of a well-connected retreat.\nUpon entering, one is welcomed into an inviting and beautifully proportioned living space, ideal for both quiet relaxation and effortless entertaining. The property comprises two well-appointed bedrooms, each providing a tranquil haven enhanced by an abundance of natural light. The kitchen is thoughtfully arranged, combining practicality with understated style to maximise both space and functionality.\nThe location is second to none, with an excellent array of amenities on the doorstep, including local shops, schools, parks, and eateries. Superb public transport links and ease of access to surrounding areas ensure that convenience is at the forefront of daily living.\nAltogether, this delightful cottage offers a harmonious balance of charm and modern-day ease. Whether embarking on homeownership or seeking a more manageable residence, 'Maresa' promises a lifestyle defined by comfort and a strong sense of community."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance hall: - \nlaminate wood flooring, central light, Alarm\n\nLiving room: - 4.18m x 3.20m\nwooden flooring, central light, picture light\n\nBedroom 1: - 3.31m x 3.02m\ndouble room, wooden flooring, central light, built-in wardrobes\n\nCorridor: - \ncentral light laminate wood flooring\n\nKitchen: - 2.86m x 2.78m\ntiled flooring, floor and eyelevel cabinets, standalone electric cooker, extractor fan, under counter fridge freezer, stainless steel sink unit, door to rear patio garden\n\nShower room: - \ntiled floors, WC, wash hand basin, window, corner shower suite with Triton electric shower\n\nBedroom 2: - 3.20m x 2.50m\ndouble room, wooden flooring, built in wardrobes and storage, central light\n\nRear patio garden: - \nwith wooden fencing and gravel\n\nTo the rear: - \na charming courtyard garden provides a private oasis — perfect for morning coffee, al fresco dining, or simply unwinding in a quiet setting. Its low-maintenance design ensures you can enjoy outdoor living with ease.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Two bright and spacious bedrooms </li><li>Welcoming living area with a warm, homely feel </li><li>Well-appointed kitchen with ample storage </li><li>Private courtyard garden low maintenance and perfect for outdoor relaxation </li><li>Prime central location close to shops, cafés, and transport links</ul>"
      },
